sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Alice as Alice (Sender)
    participant AliceApp as Alice Client
    participant API as Go Chi API (:8080)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 17
    participant Hub as Go WebSocket Hub
    participant BobApp as Bob Client
    actor Bob as Bob (Recipient)

    Alice->>AliceApp: Types "Coffee at 4?" & sends
    AliceApp->>AliceApp: Renders bubble with "pending" (clock icon)
    AliceApp->>Hub: WS Frame: event "message.send" { convId, clientMsgId, content }

    rect rgb(25, 25, 35)
        Note over API,DB: Single Atomic PostgreSQL Transaction
        Hub->>DB: Check block status, membership, and status = 'accepted'
        Hub->>DB: INSERT INTO messages (id, conv_id, sender_id, client_msg_id, content)
        Hub->>DB: INSERT INTO outbox_events (event_type, payload, target_user_ids, status)
        Hub->>DB: UPDATE conversations SET updated_at = now()
    end

    Hub-->>AliceApp: WS Frame: event "message.ack" { clientMsgId, messageId, sequenceNum }
    AliceApp->>AliceApp: Transition bubble to "sent" (single gray tick)

    Note over Hub,BobApp: At-Least-Once Outbox Dispatch
    Hub->>BobApp: WS Frame: event "message.created" { message }
    BobApp->>BobApp: Deduplicate by message.id & render in thread
    BobApp->>Hub: WS Frame: event "message.delivered" { messageId, conversationId }

    Hub->>DB: UPDATE messages SET delivered_at = now() WHERE id = $msgId
    Hub->>AliceApp: WS Frame: event "message.status" { messageId, status: "delivered" }
    AliceApp->>AliceApp: Transition bubble to "delivered" (double gray ticks)

    Note over Bob,BobApp: Visibility Policy Satisfied (Focused for >= 500ms)
    Bob->>BobApp: Views message in viewport
    BobApp->>Hub: WS Frame: event "message.read" { convId, messageId }

    Hub->>DB: UPDATE conversation_members SET last_read_message_id = $msgId (Monotonic)
    Hub->>AliceApp: WS Frame: event "message.status" { messageId, status: "read" }
    AliceApp->>AliceApp: Transition bubble to "read" (double coral ticks)
